Scenario: I booked a hotel through an online travel agency. When I arrived, the hotel said they were overbooked and moved me to another property farther away with a smaller room and no breakfast. The OTA says the hotel is responsible. The hotel says I need to deal with the OTA. I want a refund for the price difference and the inconvenience."
